...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
agent: Surelock Homes { class: ours }
openrouter: OpenRouter { class: ext }
dcfs: IL DCFS { class: ext }

user -> ui: ZIP 선택 + 실행 클릭
ui -> agent: agent.run(query, stream=True)
agent -> openrouter: 시스템 프롬프트(약 5,200자) + 도구 7개 스키마 + query
openrouter -> agent: tool_call search_childcare_providers
agent -> dcfs: GET ProviderLookup.aspx
dcfs -> agent: ViewState 폼 필드
agent -> dcfs: POST __EVENTTARGET=ASPxSearch
dcfs -> agent: CSV 응답(공급자 목록)
agent -> openrouter: tool 결과: providers 배열
